{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-66911-r4510823","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Sambal Tempoyak (Anchovies with Fermented Durian Chili Paste)","sourcePageId":66911,"sourceRevision":"4510823","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-17T13:29:51Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Sambal%20Tempoyak%20(Anchovies%20with%20Fermented%20Durian%20Chili%20Paste)&oldid=4510823","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T14:15:46.048Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Indonesian recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using anchovy","Category:Recipes using bitter bean","Category:Recipes using chile paste and sauce","Category:Recipes using coconut milk","Category:Recipes using durian","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"99779b137a040b1cec50458efb4a404c9f018d9e76cf6fdbc4e92707a7296423","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Indonesian recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of Indonesia|Cuisine of Indonesia]]\n\n==Ingredients==    \n\n* 100 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]] ikan bilis (dried [[Cookbook:Anchovy|anchovies]])\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Tempoyak|tempoyak]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Coconut|coconut milk]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pinch|pinch]] of [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 10 [[Cookbook:Chili Pepper|bird's eye chillis]] ([[W:chilli padi|chilli padi]])\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Chile Paste and Sauce|chili paste]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Centimetre (cm)|cm]] piece fresh [[Cookbook:Turmeric|turmeric root]]\n* 10 [[Cookbook:Bitter Bean|petai]] seeds, skin removed\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Oil|oil]]\n* 2 stalks [[Cookbook:Lemongrass|lemon grass]], smashed\n\n==Procedure==\n\n#Remove heads and entrails from ikan bilis. Wash and soak for 10 minutes. [[Cookbook:Deep Fat Frying|Deep-fry]] until crisp.\n#Combine 2 tbsp of tempoyak, coconut milk, salt, chilis, chili paste, turmeric root, and petai seeds. Grind to make a paste.\n#Heat oil in a pan and stir-fry the sambal paste with lemon grass until it becomes fragrant.\n#Add the rest of tempoyak and [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]] gently over low heat until gravy is thickened.\n#Add salt to taste. Serve with crisp ikan bilis, petai and rice.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using durian]]\n[[Category:Indonesian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using anchovy]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bitter bean]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chile paste and sauce]]\n[[Category:Recipes using coconut milk]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Sambal Tempoyak (Anchovies with Fermented Durian Chili Paste)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"100 g ikan bilis (dried anchovies)","sourceText":"100 g ikan bilis (dried anchovies)","amountText":"100 g ikan bilis (dried anchovies)","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"3 tbsp tempoyak","sourceText":"3 tbsp tempoyak","amountText":"3 tbsp tempoyak","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 tbsp coconut milk","sourceText":"2 tbsp coconut milk","amountText":"2 tbsp coconut milk","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 pinch of s